OL,3,GNEWSA'It's heartbreaking' - Family of
OL,4,Ahit-and-run victim speak out as driver
OL,5,Ajailed
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a west Belfast man who
OL,8,Fwas killed in a hit-and-run as he
OL,9,Fwalked his dog has branded the driver
OL,10,F"a hateful, evil person" who had shown
OL,11,F"no remorse".
OL,13,FMartin Sean O'Lali has been jailed for
OL,14,Fcausing the death by careless driving
OL,15,Fof 42-year-old Richard Boyle in 2021.
OL,17,FO'Lali, 28 of Breton Court in Lisburn,
OL,18,Fwas sentenced to two years and seven
OL,19,Fmonths in relation to what the judge
OL,20,Fdescribed in court as a "shameful
OL,21,Flitany of events".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
