OL,3,GNEWSA'It's heartbreaking' - Family of
OL,4,Ahit-and-run victim speak out as driver
OL,5,Ajailed
OL,6,
OL,7,FBelfast Crown Court heard he would
OL,8,Fserve half the sentence in custody
OL,9,Fbefore being released on licence. He
OL,10,Fwas also disqualified from driving for
OL,11,Fthree years.
